text:
Kodwa nge-letterpress ikakhulukazi, kubonakala nakakhulu!
Ukuze udale ukuphrinta okukodwa nje, zonke izinto zokwakha kufanele zidlule izigaba ezi-3:
- Ukwakhiwa - Yilapho i Print Peppermint ithimba ngokucophelela libeka i umbhalo owufunayo kugalari yohlobo. Ifomu ngalinye kufanele libekwe uhlamvu ngohlamvu, futhi umugqa ngomugqa, ngakho lihilela ukunemba okuningi nakho konke ukunaka kwethimba lethu;
- Ukubekwa - Kubandakanya ukusetha amakhasi endaweni yawo efaneleke kakhulu ukuze athole umphumela wokuphrinta owufunayo. Futhi, kuyindaba ehilela ukunemba okuningi, nokubeka iphepha ngokucophelela ukuze kuqinisekiswe ukuthi ukuphrinta kwe-letterpress kuvela ngendlela ikhasimende elilindele ngayo;
- Ukuphrinta - Yilapho uyinki usetshenziswa ohlotsheni bese ugijima ngokucindezela ukuze udale okuphrintiwe. Uyinki ucindezelwa ephepheni, futhi umklamo usuqediwe.
The Print Peppermint ithimba likholelwa ukuthi konke ukuphrinta kuwuhlobo lobuciko, kodwa sivumela uthando lwethu lwalo mkhuba luqondise ngempela umsebenzi wethu uma kuziwa ekunyatheliseni kwe-letterpress.
